  "prefLabel": "Box 602.01 Amateur Boxing",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Box 602.01 Amateur Boxing.\n\n(a) All amateur boxing competitions shall be conducted in compliance with the official rulebook of USA Boxing Inc., https://www.usaboxing.org/usa-boxing-rulebook.\n\n(b) All amateur boxing officials, including, but not limited to, referees, judges, timekeepers, physicians, and clerks, shall register and become certified by the New England Association of USA Boxing, Inc. and shall be under the oversight and direction of the commission.\n\nSource. #10483, eff 12-5-13; ss by #14036 eff 7-30-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/box100-800.html"
